learnings:
  - Law 1 counts turn.sent rows; a steer is not a new turn so it needs no new permit
  - A permitId with steer is refused rather than ignored
tags:
  - decision
body: 'No ABI extension was made. When no endpoint is capable the fallback card carries the first endpoint''s reason. Roots inside the Gnomon home are now refused too (found while planning G-LCL-06: the tools would otherwise confine to keys/).'
